WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.328
Deep learning uses many neural-network layers to transform input into a useful result.

00:00:05.328 --> 00:00:10.656
Early layers notice simple signals, like edges, colors, or short sounds.

00:00:10.656 --> 00:00:15.984
Middle layers combine simple pieces into shapes, parts, or sound patterns.

00:00:15.984 --> 00:00:21.312
Later layers recognize a whole object, word, or intent.

00:00:21.312 --> 00:00:26.640
Richer patterns need enough examples, compute, and careful evaluation.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:31.968
Deep learning learns increasingly useful representations through many connected layers.
